SUMMARY:The Moon occults Alcyone (disappearance only)
DESCRIPTION:Alcyone disappears at 22:21:25 CST\, seen from Jiangmen\, CN.\n
 The Moon sets during the occultation: only the disappearance is above the 
 horizon.\nThe Moon is 1° up in the WNW · dark sky.\nTimes for the Moon's
  mean limb\, ±2 s.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon's edge: https:
 //occult.alokm.com/alcyone-2028-03-30?lat=22.5833&lon=113.0833
